WEBVTT

00:00:00.111 --> 00:00:05.755
Create a timetable

00:00:05.805 --> 00:00:09.024
Open Academics, then Timetable.

00:00:11.767 --> 00:00:15.446
Select the class whose timetable you want to create.

00:00:16.949 --> 00:00:27.756
The rows are the time slots. Click a cell, choose the subject for that period, and press Set. The teacher assigned to the subject is filled in for you.

00:00:28.220 --> 00:00:33.213
Press Save Timetable. Students and parents can now see it.

00:00:36.124 --> 00:00:40.804
The timetable is saved
